[00:00.72]Lesson 73 | 第73课
[00:03.28]The way to King Street | 去国王街的路
[00:06.87]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.47]Why did the man need a phrasebook? | 那个男人为什么需要一本短语手册?
[00:18.73]Last week Mrs. Mills went to London. | 上周米尔斯夫人去了伦敦。
[00:23.59]She does not know London very well, and she lost her way. | 她不太熟悉伦敦,因此迷了路。
[00:30.47]Suddenly, she saw a man near a bus stop. | 突然,她在公共汽车站附近看见了一个男人。
[00:36.34]'I can ask him the way,' she said to herself. | '我可以向他问路,'她自言自语道。
[00:41.82]'Excuse me,' she said. | '打扰一下,'她说道。
[00:45.24]'Can you tell me the way to King Street, please?' | '请问您能告诉我去国王街的路吗?'
[00:51.12]The man smiled pleasantly. | 那个男人愉快地笑了。
[00:54.68]He did not understand English! | 他不懂英语!
[00:58.53]He spoke German. | 他说德语。
[01:01.16]He was a tourist. | 他是一名游客。
[01:04.17]Then he put his hand into his pocket, and took out a phrasebook. | 然后他把手伸进口袋,掏出了一本短语手册。
[01:11.87]He opened the book and found a phrase. | 他翻开书找到了一个短语。
[01:16.80]He read the phrase slowly. | 他慢慢地读那个短语。
[01:21.54]'I am sorry,' he said. | '很抱歉,'他说道。
[01:25.08]'I do not speak English.' | '我不会说英语。'